  - Normalized Burn Ratio
  - Google Earth Engine
  - Mizoram
abstract: >-
  Google Earth Engine code and reference data for mapping annual shifting-cultivation
  (jhum) clearing from harmonized Landsat 5/7/8/9 with a two-branch rule on symmetric
  anniversary composites of the Normalized Burn Ratio. Independently validated with blind
  stratified samples for 2025 (310 points) and 2010 (160 points) in Mizoram, north-east
  India; includes the annual area series 1989-2025.
